<title>USA: Forest Labs to buy back up to two mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Forest Labs to buy back up to two mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forest Laboratories Inc said Thursday its board of directors authorized the repurchase of up to two million of the company's outstanding shares in the open market.</p>
<p>This was in addition to the 4.5 million share repurchase authorized in May 1996, which Forest said was almost complete. The company said there was no specific date for completing the buy back.</p>
</text>
